## 00-problem-map.md#5CD0
 29:- `backend/src/modules/tournaments/tournaments.controller.ts:1641-1662`: route self-consent đã có; phần cần sửa là UI non-blocking và điểm nhập consent sau khi organizer thêm/guest claim, không tạo route trùng.
*30:- `web/src/app/(public)/tournaments/[id]/components/RegisterModal.tsx:36-47` và `DoublesRegistrationFlow.tsx:417-425`: Web chặn đăng ký nếu chưa consent.
*31:- `app/lib/features/register/screens/tournament_register_screen.dart:537-555`: Flutter chặn đăng ký nếu chưa consent; `football_team_register_screen.dart:251-262` gửi `rankingConsent: true`.
 32:- `backend/src/modules/tournaments/services/ranking-consent.service.ts:17-20,42-109`: giới hạn hiện tại 3 notification tổng, delay hiện hữu 24h/72h; không đổi lịch.
 33:- `backend/src/modules/rankings/rankings.service.ts:1787-1834,2034-2079`: replay kiểm consent theo từng phía nhưng thiếu `isRanked` và guest slot; apply helper tại `:2279-2329` đã kiểm ranked, hai phía không rỗng và timestamp.
 34:- `backend/src/modules/rankings/rankings.service.ts:264-306`: `updateMatchElo` đã gọi `hasEligibleRankingConsent`; mở rộng shared helper cho guest và giữ test đường này, không tạo gate trùng.
## 02-backend-feature-design.md#2D98
 47:- Enqueue: chỉ `isRanked=true`, participant hai bên đều có ít nhất một roster user, không có guest slot, mọi `rankingConsentAt != null && <= updated.completedAt`.
*48:- Apply: giữ `hasEligibleRankingConsent` hiện có, bổ sung guest-slot check trước cả football và normal ELO; gate đã kiểm ranked, timestamp, nonempty sides.
 49:- Replay: thêm filter `isRanked=true`, consent/guest gate trước bất kỳ delete/insert history; test destructive writes.
 50:- Manual `updateMatchElo`: đã gọi shared gate; mở rộng helper để reject guest slot và regression-test trực tiếp method.
 51:- `insertAdminEloHistory` không nằm trong tournament consent gate.
## 09-test-plan.md#37F4
 5:- Unit/service tests: manager denied; accepted/non-deleted friend succeeds; pending/deleted friend fails at write; club membership must be JOINED and scoped; already rostered/capacity/registration lock rejects atomically.
*6:- Direct entry: name-only guest succeeds; verified exact email account links; unverified matching account does not link; email optional; direct player count validates singles/doubles/team; note max/trim; fee snapshot uses division fee once; presence defaults false.
 7:- Claim: valid token + verified matching email claims once; missing email requires manual token; invalid/expired/reused token, wrong verified email, inactive participant, duplicate roster all reject without partial writes; raw token absent from logs/storage.
 8:- Consent: optional/omitted registration allowed; checked registration sets consent only on current user; organizer-add leaves consent null; self-confirm idempotent; claimed user starts null.
*9:- ELO: enqueue rejects rosterless/guest/unranked/missing/late consent; apply rejects unranked/empty/guest/late consent including football; replay never deletes or inserts on denied path; `updateMatchElo` rejects without consent; `insertAdminEloHistory` remains unaffected.
 10:- Reminder: only ranked active roster on non-ended tournament and verified email; removed/ended rows skipped; hostile HTML escaped; concurrent service instances send once; failed send does not increment; successful send increments exactly once and cap/delay unchanged.
